claude session_01YMmUap8wenmYUk1yBt9Gzm (nadia-fable), 2026-09-29, nadia NAD-14/NAD-20: Fleet.Command (Spawn | Send with a `by` principal), its JSON, `Fleet.commands(topic, allow, from)` — the service folds the commands topic as it grows, applies or appends `refused` to the agents record; Event.Refused, Spawned carries `by`. Additive in okay-agent (sprint.d/doing/fleet-commands.md)
